type: text
aliases: donating, howtodonate

---

If you want to donate money to rtm516, you can do it through my GitHub Sponsors page here: https://github.com/sponsors/rtm516
Once you have sponsored $5 or more, run `/verify` to link your GitHub account and you will automatically be given the donator role.

Please don’t donate specifically to request a specific feature. If you would like a feature to be implemented, create an issue on the GitHub repo and fill out the correct template!
